# CALLS-LABEL: unit f0:Body
# CALLS-COUNT-3: Call Function AllocatingConstructEntry {{*}}"RestMaker"
# RUN(DEEP): bytes f2:Body mechanisms=none+TypedOperations
# DEEP-LABEL: unit f2:Body
# DEEP: Call Function AllocatingConstructEntry {{*}}"DeepMaker"

